d level, and chaos all around? Welcome to the club, Olaf! This booze-loving dwarf knows how to party hard, but the morning after is always a different story. In Olaf the Boozer, you'll have to unravel the tangled web of events from his epic night using the unique time-rewinding mechanic! Get ready for a hilarious journey in the style of the beloved Skyrim quest \"A Night to Remember,\" but with a dwarven twist and puzzles that will make you think\u2026 in reverse!", "summary": "Olaf wakes up with a legendary hangover and a missing royal crown. Retrace your drunken rampage across the kingdom to save your head! In this comedic puzzle adventure, fixing the mess creates the maze: every object you repair becomes an obstacle blocking your path.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/olaf-and-the-crowning-hangover", "videos": [{"id": 164210, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "nZbBqQrKzsQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nZbBqQrKzsQ", "title": "Olaf and the Crowning Hangover - Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nZbBqQrKzsQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 141224, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "zrmLLX8FL70", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zrmLLX8FL70", "title": "Olaf the Boozer - Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zrmLLX8FL70/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 141225, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "rt7qkcmKEzs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rt7qkcmKEzs", "title": "Olaf the Boozer - Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rt7qkcmKEzs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 188579, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "Nq2HYoE-9nk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nq2HYoE-9nk", "title": "Olaf and the Crowning Hangover \u2013 The Story Begins", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Nq2HYoE-9nk/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}